# Color Carousel — 20 colored cards in a horizontal snapping ScrollView with a
# 3D coverflow (scale/rotateY/zIndex per item from the scroll offset) and a Skia
# radial gradient that animates (withTiming) to the active card's accent color.
# What this test covers: single-step drags left and right (snapToOffsets), a slow
# drag released between snap points, hard flings to both ends including
# overscroll past the null padding items (activeIndex outside the colors ->
# background fallback), a fling reversed mid-momentum, and stepping back.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/color-carousel"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait 1500
# One card to the left (next), then one back.
gesture pan 330 437 -80 0 400
wait 1000
gesture pan 330 437 -80 0 400
wait 1000
gesture pan 70 437 80 0 400
wait 1000
# Slow drag that ends between two snap offsets.
gesture pan 300 437 -120 0 1200
wait 1200
# Fling hard to the end and overscroll beyond the last color.
gesture fling left 340 437 280
wait 400
gesture fling left 340 437 280
wait 400
gesture fling left 340 437 280
wait 1500
gesture pan 300 437 -250 0 300
wait 1500
# Fling back, then reverse direction while momentum is still running.
gesture fling right 60 437 280
wait 150
gesture fling left 340 437 200
wait 1500
# Back to the very start and overscroll past the first color.
gesture fling right 60 437 280
wait 400
gesture fling right 60 437 280
wait 400
gesture fling right 60 437 280
wait 400
gesture fling right 60 437 280
wait 1500
gesture pan 100 437 250 0 300
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
